  "details": "Right now, if you want to use the ContactReceiver on a game object, such as a UI button, you cannot forward the events to the same target script as the UI button.\n\nI suggest adding the same UX of UI buttons to forward the same contact event to the right target game object's event.\n\nAlternatively, adding a reference to the target game object with the overrides is possible too, but then we lose the origin/context (what UI button did send this event?).\n\nFor now, players will have to make a proxy-script on the contact receiver and handle the forwarding there, which is unfortunate, as the ContactReceiver allows setting parents.",
